🔄 PHASE 4: BACKTRACKING - CHOICE AND UNDO (Problems 31-40)
===============================================================================

Pattern: Try → Recurse → Undo
Focus: Systematic exploration with backtracking

Problem 31: Print All Permutations of String ⭐⭐⭐
-------------------------------------------------
Concept: Arrangement generation with backtracking
Logic: Fix each character at each position, recurse, backtrack
Key Learning: Swapping technique in backtracking

Problem 32: Print All Permutations of Array ⭐⭐⭐
------------------------------------------------
Concept: Array permutation with duplicates handling
Logic: Use swapping or visited array approach
Key Learning: Handling duplicate elements

Problem 33: Combination Sum ⭐⭐⭐
------------------------------
Concept: Finding combinations that sum to target
Logic: Include current element multiple times or exclude
Key Learning: Unlimited use of elements

Problem 34: Letter Combinations of Phone Number ⭐⭐⭐
---------------------------------------------------
Concept: Mapping and combination generation
Logic: For each digit, try all corresponding letters
Key Learning: Multi-mapping in recursion

Problem 35: Sudoku Solver ⭐⭐⭐⭐
------------------------------
Concept: Constraint satisfaction problem
Logic: Fill empty cell, check validity, recurse, backtrack
Key Learning: Complex constraint checking

Problem 36: N-Queens Problem ⭐⭐⭐⭐
---------------------------------
Concept: Placement problem with multiple constraints
Logic: Place queen in each row, check conflicts, backtrack
Key Learning: Multiple constraint validation

Problem 37: Rat in a Maze ⭐⭐⭐
-----------------------------
Concept: Path finding with obstacles
Logic: Try all four directions, mark visited, backtrack
Key Learning: Grid traversal with backtracking

Problem 38: Word Search in Grid ⭐⭐⭐
-----------------------------------
Concept: Pattern matching in 2D grid
Logic: Start from each cell, try to form word in all directions
Key Learning: String matching with backtracking

Problem 39: Palindrome Partitioning ⭐⭐⭐⭐
------------------------------------------
Concept: String partitioning with constraints
Logic: Try all possible cuts, check palindrome, recurse
Key Learning: Dynamic constraint checking

Problem 40: Restore IP Addresses ⭐⭐⭐⭐
------------------------------------
Concept: String segmentation with validation
Logic: Try placing dots, validate segments, backtrack
Key Learning: Format validation in recursion

