Problem 44: Longest Common Subsequence ⭐⭐⭐⭐
---------------------------------------------
Concept: Dynamic programming with memoization
Logic: If characters match, recurse for both; else try both options
Key Learning: Optimization with memoization

Problem 45: Edit Distance (Levenshtein) ⭐⭐⭐⭐
---------------------------------------------
