Key Learning: State machine simulation

Problem 48: Word Break Problem ⭐⭐⭐⭐
-----------------------------------
Concept: String segmentation with dictionary
Logic: Try all possible prefixes, check in dictionary, recurse
Key Learning: Dictionary-based validation

Problem 49: Longest Increasing Subsequence ⭐⭐⭐⭐
------------------------------------------------
Concept: Sequence optimization problem
Logic: For each element, include if greater or exclude
Key Learning: Sequence constraint handling

Problem 50: Boolean Expression Evaluation ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
-------------------------------------------------
Concept: Complex expression parsing and evaluation
